                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3ba7323a-4c7b-3876-bce0-aadbd9232ff2",
                        "entry_id": "365f5e98-e976-3df1-bfa2-73219ff18ceb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "товарищ по битвам; тот, кто сражается вместе с кем-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5d96835e-9c59-4dab-855e-fa8c34c95916",
                                "sense_id": "3ba7323a-4c7b-3876-bce0-aadbd9232ff2",
                                "text": "Теперь, с некоторой уже «исторической перспективы», взирая на эти далекие события, испытываю все то же чувство глубокого умиления и гордости перед неугасимым воинским духом, доблестью и самоотверженным патриотизмом моих соратников по Железной дивизии"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f7d1e4a6-f871-4690-8a07-b850b339f1ea",
                                "sense_id": "3ba7323a-4c7b-3876-bce0-aadbd9232ff2",
                                "text": "Герой, соратник Суворова, соперник в подвигах с Нельсоном, адмирал Ф. Ф. Ушаков считался создателем Черноморского флота и новатором в военно-морском искусстве"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0c6a4df0-abd7-39f6-a37d-b44c19ea2097",
                        "entry_id": "365f5e98-e976-3df1-bfa2-73219ff18ceb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен. единомышленник и товарищ по борьбе, какой-либо деятельности; сподвижник"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0cfd90cb-2464-40d9-8041-e0e739f4f63b",
                                "sense_id": "0c6a4df0-abd7-39f6-a37d-b44c19ea2097",
                                "text": "Да в том, что, кроме бурного его таланта, он сумел собрать подле себя дружину, он действовал не один, в окружении не лаборантов и помощников, а скорее ― соратников, сомысленников."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "626f2fc3-093a-4d27-a7c3-99740981d02c",
                        "source_entry_id": "365f5e98-e976-3df1-bfa2-73219ff18ceb",
                        "source_sense_description": "тот, кто сражается вместе с кем-либо",
                        "target_lang_word": "companion-in-arms",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5410a636-6277-43d1-bd35-439960e0be07",
                        "source_entry_id": "365f5e98-e976-3df1-bfa2-73219ff18ceb",
                        "source_sense_description": "тот, кто сражается вместе с кем-либо",
                        "target_lang_word": "compañero de armas",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5e142aa5-16e6-47d0-b92f-62a37cd3934f",
                        "source_entry_id": "365f5e98-e976-3df1-bfa2-73219ff18ceb",
                        "source_sense_description": "тот, кто сражается вместе с кем-либо",
                        "target_lang_word": "conmilitón",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "be8cf7d5-239b-479d-bd35-39ec678bde1e",
                        "source_entry_id": "365f5e98-e976-3df1-bfa2-73219ff18ceb",
                        "source_sense_description": "сподвижник",
                        "target_lang_word": "comrade",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "comrade",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "37351855-39e9-34a9-b7df-049c75efba32",
                                        "entry_id": "71d5bc83-a3cd-30c8-a29a-32e247ebd1fa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A mate, companion, or associate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e537c8dd-ea2b-4941-947f-0759c3d8bdc6",
                                                "sense_id": "37351855-39e9-34a9-b7df-049c75efba32",
                                                "text": "[… these tears] Which weep the comrade of my choice,\n⁠An awful thought, a life removed,\n⁠The human-hearted man I loved,\nA spirit, not a breathing voice."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cceeea89-eb40-3113-8050-16202cc23347",
                                        "entry_id": "71d5bc83-a3cd-30c8-a29a-32e247ebd1fa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A mate, companion, or associate.",
                                            "A companion in battle; fellow soldier."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9af4949e-f05f-4ad9-80f9-a098693848df",
                                                "sense_id": "cceeea89-eb40-3113-8050-16202cc23347",
                                                "text": "Wierzbowski and his men were so exhausted that they could hardly stay awake, but they knew they could not abandon their wounded comrades."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5629d850-cc95-3bc2-98d1-8bcf755805c9",
                                        "entry_id": "71d5bc83-a3cd-30c8-a29a-32e247ebd1fa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fellow socialist, communist or other similarly politically aligned person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94923d27-fd6e-495b-a9ab-9b31b13bfd20",
                                                "sense_id": "5629d850-cc95-3bc2-98d1-8bcf755805c9",
                                                "text": "Hello, comrade. Are you going to the Communist Party meeting tonight?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8074cee5-3145-3482-bbdd-0e8b5ccf724a",
                                        "entry_id": "71d5bc83-a3cd-30c8-a29a-32e247ebd1fa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A non-hierarchical title, functionally similar to \\\"Mr.\\\", \\\"Mrs.\\\", \\\"Miss\\\", \\\"Ms.\\\" etc, in a communist, socialist, or rarely in an Islamist state."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78086df8-b4e3-4be6-a017-d7d0a3ee59c1",
                                                "sense_id": "8074cee5-3145-3482-bbdd-0e8b5ccf724a",
                                                "text": "Comrade Lenin inspired our people to undertake great works."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "comrade",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8d2a84be-95b5-32b6-ba87-1f3dc155c2b2",
                                        "entry_id": "0f637d6a-1f75-35bc-897d-f03cce7f31c9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To associate with someone in a friendly way."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "861ccf55-1935-4ae0-a0a0-82af27c46f74",
                                                "sense_id": "8d2a84be-95b5-32b6-ba87-1f3dc155c2b2",
                                                "text": "But she was happy, for she was far away under another sky, and comrading again with her Rangers, and her animal friends, and the soldiers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
